    "created_at": "2023-06-29T19:35:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-29T19:35:48Z",
    "body": "> It seems a confusing to have a script _referrer policy_ member and a _script fetch options referrer policy_ member\r\n\r\nI think the confusion anyway exists: in the current PR, it's just _script fetch options referrer policy after updated_ vs. _script fetch options referrer policy before updated_ rather than separate members.\r\n\r\nBut I anyway don't want to block this due to this issue (just weak preference), so probably we can just proceed with the current PR, if others don't have strong objections.",
